        en: "This distinction between design for cause and design for effect was first described in the seminal 1978 article ‘Game Design: Art or Science’ [4] in relation to two popular board war games of the time, and the merits of each side have been debated ever since. Game designer Alan Emrich later defined these terms as follows:¹",
