        type: "p",
        zh: "仅仅是看一眼图 24 所示的那令人生畏的棋盘和棋子的起始布局，就足以让即使是最铁杆的玩家也踌躇不前。引用著名的游戏史学家 H. J. R. Murray 的话 [19, p. 227]：",
        en: "The mere sight of the imposing board and starting configuration of pieces shown in Figure 24 would be enough to give pause to even the most hardcore gamer. To quote noted game historian H. J. R. Murray [19, p. 227]:",
